{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5dce0d8e-970a-842a-abf0-5e37154dcfda",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T10:55:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Miguel Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:50:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Oh, hello. Sorry, I was not expecting a person. I thought it would be the, you know, the menu, press one, press two. You caught me off guard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:50:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you got me. We still answer the phones here, at least on a Thursday morning. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:50:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. So I want to get a license for my dog. I have the application, I printed it, but there is a line that says rabies certificate. And I am not sure what that means. What counts for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:51:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. That's the paperwork from your vet showing the dog's rabies vaccine is current. Usually it's a certificate they hand you after the shot, with the dog's name, the date, and when it expires. Do you have something like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:51:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I have a paper from the vet, yes. It is a receipt, I think. It says vaccine on it, and the amount I paid. Is the receipt okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:51:34-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, a receipt on its own might not do it. Look for the word rabies on it, and a vaccination date, and the expiration or a tag number. If it's all on there, it may be fine. If not, your vet's office can print or email you the certificate, they do it all the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:51:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I check three things. The word rabies, the date of the shot, and the expiration. And maybe a tag number. Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:52:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly that. And the dog's name, so we know it matches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The dog's name. Okay. Wait, it says Biscuit on top, but on my application I wrote Biscuit Cordero. Is that a problem? The last name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:52:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. The name on the application just needs to line up with the dog's name and your name as the owner. Vets usually put the owner's name on it too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:52:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. The owner is me, Miguel Cordero. It has my name, I think. I will look again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:52:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, one more question. What is the fee? For the license. I want to bring the right money."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:52:45-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the fee can depend on a couple of things, like whether the dog is spayed or neutered, and I don't want to quote you a number off the top of my head and have you come in short. Is Biscuit fixed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:53:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fixed. Yes, neutered. The vet paper maybe says that too. So that is one more thing to check on the paper, neutered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:53:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. If the certificate doesn't say it, bring any proof from the vet. When you come in, the counter will give you the exact amount for a neutered dog. Or I can have you hold and I'll check the fee sheet, if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:53:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes please, I can hold. Thank you, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:53:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just a minute, hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:53:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Sorry, I'm going to have you come by the counter for the exact fee, because I'm looking at two sheets and I want to be sure which one is current. It's a modest amount, nothing big. Cash, check, or card here at the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I do not get the number today, but it is not big, and I pay at the window. Cash, check, or card. I understand. Maybe. Is it for one year or more years?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The license runs for a set period and the counter staff will tell you which when you pay. I don't want to say the wrong thing. They'll explain it, I promise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:54:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And I bring the application, the rabies paper, and the neutered proof. And my ID, maybe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:54:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A photo ID is a good idea, yes. And since you're on Bellevue Avenue, you're in Newport, right? Two sixteen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, two sixteen Bellevue Avenue. I am the homeowner. Okay, so Newport, good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. We're open until the afternoon today, so you can come in whenever. And if the receipt doesn't have what we talked about, call your vet first, it'll save you a trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:54:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will call the vet first. Thank you so much. Sorry, I am still a little unsure about the fee, but I will ask at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:54:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, they'll sort you out. Say hi to Biscuit for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:54:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Sandra. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T10:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Miguel. Bye now."
    }
  ],
